   212	during construction.  Its final SHA-256 is
   213	`bf1cca1c9f6ca6e8178453bc46114854d97627930072093c07e01618cf9cb1b0`.
   214	
   215	## Gate results
   216	
   217	### Gate A — PASS
   218	
   219	- A1: the exact closure body from `solution.mpy` is present in the entry claim
   220	  and executes under fixed semantics.  Changing `balance = 0` to `balance = 1`
